+# Password hashing
+
+No current decision on the password hashing algorithm is recorded for this project. The project's records hold only two unconfirmed conversation excerpts that mention different algorithms (bcrypt and argon2id), and nothing records that either was adopted or that one replaced the other, so no algorithm is stated here. This policy should be updated once the maintainers record a decision.
